# 1.1: the sleep timer (ZEN-1's and Penumbra's idea). Setup's ALGORITHM: off, 15 or 30 minutes, 1, 2, 4 or 8 hours
# from the last touch. The sound fades out over the last 30 s (a touch then brings it back up); then the music stops,
# the screen and the lights go dark. A new press, key or turn wakes it, and only wakes it: the music again if it was
# playing, faded in. Not saved: off at every start
wait 500
expect playing 1
expect sleep 0
expect gain 4096
expect screen 1
expect piece 0
listen
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 6
# a step a detent: off at the left, 8 hours at the right
turn ALGO 1
wait 200
expect sleep 15
said sleep in 15 minutes
turn ALGO 10
wait 200
expect sleep 480
said sleep in 8 hours
turn ALGO -20
wait 200
expect sleep 0
said sleep off
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
shot setup.png
where
said Setup page, sleep in 15 minutes
# off the Setup page, ALGORITHM does what it did (HOME: nothing); the time runs from the last touch
tap HOME
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
expect sleep 15
expect view 0
# 14 minutes on: whole
wait 840000
expect gain 4096
expect asleep 0
# 14 m 45 s: half way down the fade, by the square a quarter
wait 45000
expect gain >800
expect gain <1250
# a touch: back up within a second, and the time starts again
tapkey w0
wait 1100
expect gain 4096
# 14 m 20 s after that: still whole (the fade is the last 30 s)
wait 858900
expect gain 4096
# 15 m 1 s: asleep. Stopped as PLAY stops it, dark, silent
wait 41000
expect asleep 1
expect screen 0
expect gain 0
expect playing 0
said sleeping
expect litbtn10 0
expect litkey0 0
shot asleep.png
peakreset
wait 2000
expect peak_db_max -120
# MIDI does not wake it
midi 90 3C 64
wait 200
midi 80 3C 00
wait 200
expect asleep 1
# FX wakes it, and only wakes it (not its page): the music again, faded in
press FX
wait 100
expect asleep 0
expect screen 1
expect gain >0
expect gain <500
said awake
release FX
wait 100
expect view 0
expect playing 1
wait 1000
expect gain 4096
# once nothing has been touched for a moment, a touch is a touch again
wait 300
tap FX
wait 100
expect view 5
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
# asleep again; a turn of PRESET wakes it and moves nothing
wait 905000
expect asleep 1
turn PRESET 1
wait 50
expect asleep 0
expect piece 0
wait 400
turn PRESET 1
wait 100
expect piece 1
# resting when it falls asleep: resting when it wakes
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect playing 0
wait 905000
expect asleep 1
tapkey w3
wait 200
expect asleep 0
expect playing 0
# awake, a note from outside is a touch: someone playing it from a MIDI keyboard is not faded out
wait 600000
midi 90 3C 64
wait 100
midi 80 3C 00
wait 600000
expect asleep 0
expect gain 4096
wait 300500
expect asleep 1
# not saved: off after a restart
reboot
wait 500
expect sleep 0
expect asleep 0
expect screen 1
expect gain 4096
